34 (close)"],["RS rating 70 or higher (desk RS)",true,"RS 71"]],"tt_pass":false,"desk":{"setups":[{"k":"Wyckoff spring (uptrend)","status":"spring forming","pivot":35.94,"stop":32.98,"tf":"W","actionable":false,"date":"2026-10-07","score":10,"pnl":{"state":"pending","side":"long","entry":35.9359,"stop":32.9769,"last":33.95,"last_date":"2026-10-07","to_entry_pct":5.85}}],"setups_asof":"2026-10-07","vsa":{"label":"Wyckoff spring (uptrend)","headline":"7 Oct test - low significance in a downtrend; Neutral 50","balance":"Neutral","score":50,"narrative":"Context now: downtrend (falling 50-day, -12% in 20 bars); price at new 20-bar lows; effort to fall 8 Sep on 1.4x volume, closed on the low - but a wide down bar inside an uptrend: watch whether it is tested (low significance); a no-demand bar 11 Sep on volume 18% below average - but no demand in the range: no professional interest in higher prices yet (low significance); last 5 bars: down bars on heavier volume (1.3x vs 0.8x) = supply in control; latest: test 7 Oct on 0.8x volume, closed on the high - but a test in a weak market: only counts if price responds at once, at support / new lows (low significance) (awaiting next bar); balance neutral 50/100.","status":"spring forming","last_sign":{"name":"Test","d":"2026-10-07","pol":1,"sig":0.23,"tier":"low","why":"a test in a weak market: only counts if price responds at once","ref":null},"key_bars":[{"name":"Test","d":"2026-10-07","pol":1,"sig":0.23,"tier":"low"}],"asof":null},"scores":{"overall":39,"group":"SIC 73 Business Services & Software","group_rank":12,"group_n":36,"sector_rank":154,"sector_n":519,"earn":18}},"biz":{"name":"ROBERT HALF INC.","desc":"Robert Half Inc. provides talent solutions and business consulting services in the United States and internationally. The company operates through three segments: Contract Talent Solutions, Permanent Placement Talent Solutions, and Protiviti. The Contract Talent Solutions segment provides contract engagement professionals in the fields of finance and accounting, technology, marketing and creative, legal and administrative, and customer support. The Permanent Placement Talent Solutions segment engages in the placement of full-time accounting, finance, and tax and accounting operations personnel. The Protiviti segment offers a range of consulting and managed solutions for regulatory compliance, finance, technology, operations, data, digital, legal, HR, governance, risk, and internal audit. The company markets its contract talent and permanent placement services to clients and employment candidates through national and local advertising activities, including radio, digital advertising, job boards, alliance partners, and events. The company offers its services primarily under the Robert Half and Protiviti brands. The company was formerly known as Robert Half International Inc. and changed its name to Robert Half Inc. in July 2023. Robert Half Inc. was founded in 1948 and is headquartered in Menlo Park, California.","desc_src":"Yahoo Finance profile via yfinance (third-party)","sic":"7363","sic_desc":"Services-Help Supply Services","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Staffing & Employment Services","mcap":3697308928,"mcap_src":"Yahoo Finance profile (third-party, cached)","hq":"MENLO PARK, CA","exchange":"XNYS","fy_end":"1231","cik":315213,"state_inc":"DE","massive_note":"Massive ticker details not fetched yet (5 calls/min limit; filled in on a nightly run)","sec_asof":"2026-10-08"},"fin":{"available":true,"src":"SEC EDGAR XBRL companyfacts","asof":"2026-10-03","q":[{"end":"2023-09-30","rev":1563812000.0,"rev_yoy":-14.7,"eps":0.9,"eps_yoy":-41.2,"ni":95545000.0,"ni_yoy":-42.5,"nm":6.1,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2023-12-31","rev":1472892000.0,"rev_yoy":-14.7,"eps":0.84,"eps_yoy":-39.1,"ni":87304000.0,"ni_yoy":-40.9,"nm":5.9,"derived":["eps","rev","ni"],"fp":null},{"end":"2024-03-31","rev":1475937000.0,"rev_yoy":-14.0,"eps":0.61,"eps_yoy":-46.5,"ni":63701000.0,"ni_yoy":-47.8,"nm":4.